      "Monthly calendar means align frequency but source observation dates within the month differ.",
      "Correlation and endpoint co-movement do not establish causation.",
      "The term premium is an estimate, not an observed spread between Treasury maturities.",
      "The mortgage rate contains credit, prepayment, servicing, and other spreads beyond Treasury term premium.",
      "Historical ACM estimates reflect the downloaded vintage; this analysis does not claim real-time forecasting performance.",
      "Duration is a standardized benchmark calculation, not an individual bond observation."
